WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.220
I want to take up in volume four at December 26, 1902 and this is a very important message.

2
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:18.860
As I was in my usual state, Louisa said, "I felt all oppressed and with a fear of receiving

3
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:26.380
persecutions, contrasts and calamities, not only to myself, but I do not care about myself

4
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:32.320
because I am a poor creature who is worth nothing, but the confessor and other priests

5
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.820
so Louisa is worried about the priests."

6
00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:41.780
So I felt my heart crushed by this weight, unable to find respite.

7
00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:48.660
In the meantime, my adorable Jesus came telling me, "My daughter, why be disturbed and restless

8
00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.180
and waste time like this?"

9
00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:56.280
Now, we're coming to the end of volume four and the Lord has been telling her for four

10
00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:03.280
volumes that we must not allow disturbance to get inside of us because that blocks God

11
00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:10.540
from being able to work with us and it allows Satan to get a foothold in us.

12
00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:14.480
Satan needs disturbance to work and God needs peace.

13
00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.900
So he's telling Louisa that she's wasting time.

14
00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.820
As for your own things, he said, "There's nothing there because she's living totally

15
00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:25.020
surrendered to him."

16
00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:30.820
And besides, everything is divine providence and it's a very, very important message.

17
00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.220
Everything is divine providence.

18
00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:38.740
And it is divine providence that allows colonies and persecutions and contrasts.

19
00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:46.860
And this in order to justify man and to make him come back into union with his Creator.

20
00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:52.620
One by one, without human support, just as he came out when he was created.

21
00:01:52.620 --> 00:02:01.300
Now I want to give you Psalm 104, 1, 4, 5, verse 17, God only ever acts out of love.

22
00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:07.860
And I want to give you one John 4, 7 to 17, God is love.

23
00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:08.860
Okay.

24
00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:14.460
So anything that God allows to happen to us is pure love.

25
00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:23.140
We don't like this in terms of calamities and detractions and persecutions and stuff.

26
00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:28.500
We don't like when it happens to us and our temptation is to react negatively instead

27
00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:35.460
of surrendering to the Lord, forgiving everybody, everything, and remaining in union with God

28
00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:40.940
and offering the suffering with the sufferings of Jesus, with his holy will, for the redemption

29
00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:45.180
of the very people who are causing the problems and further redemption of the world.

30
00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.580
And therefore you're in a win-win situation.

31
00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:52.940
And Jesus says, that works to justify you as well.

32
00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.500
Okay.

33
00:02:54.500 --> 00:03:00.760
As good and holy as a person may be, he always keeps something of the human spirit in his

34
00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:02.620
interior.

35
00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:08.060
And also in his exterior, he's not perfectly free.

36
00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:14.380
He always keeps something human for which he hopes, on which he relies and leans and through

37
00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.580
which he wants to obtain esteem and respect.

38
00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:22.540
The Lord knows us better than we know ourselves.

39
00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:27.460
But let the wind of calamities, persecutions and contrasts come a little bit over what

40
00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:32.820
a devastating hail the human spirit receives.

41
00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:41.500
In fact, seeing himself opposed, unpopular, despised by others, man no longer finds satisfaction

42
00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.780
