So reduced to this state, he remains alone.

47
00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:11.660
But man cannot be nor is he made to be alone.

48
00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:17.380
That's what the Lord said in Genesis 3, it's not good for man to be a Genesis 2, it's not

